# Sibling repositories, linked for local development:
#   ln -s ../../<repo>/addons/<addon> addons/<addon>
# gs-core is the one dependency. gs-loadout is linked only so the self-test can run
# GSInvLoadoutLink against the real document; the addon itself never names it.
